'''Pokémon: Mewtwo — Prologue to Awakening''' (Japanese: '''ミュウツー ～覚醒への序章～''' ''Mewtwo: The Prologue to its Awakening'') is a special episode that serves as a prologue to ''[[M16|Genesect and the Legend Awakened]]''. It first aired in Japan on July 11, 2013 and in the United States on January 11, 2014.

It was released in Japan on December 18, 2013 as part of the "Mewtwo Box" DVD collection, which also includes ''[[M01|Mewtwo Strikes Back]]'', ''[[Mewtwo Returns]]'', ''Genesect and the Legend Awakened'', and ''[[PK25|Eevee & Friends]]''.

